import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="隐私政策"
	titleEn="Privacy Policy"
	description="Mycelium Protocol 博客的隐私政策：我们收集哪些数据、如何使用 Cookie 与 Google AdSense 广告，以及你如何管理自己的选择。"
	descriptionEn="Privacy policy of the Mycelium Protocol blog: what data we collect, how cookies and Google AdSense ads are used, and how you can manage your choices."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-09-24')}
	category="Other"
	tags={['privacy']}
>

<h1>隐私政策</h1>
<p>生效日期：2026 年 9 月 24 日</p>
<p>本政策说明 blog.mushroom.cv（以下简称"本站"）在你访问时会处理哪些信息。本站不需要注册，也不出售任何个人信息。</p>

<h2>我们收集的信息</h2>
<ul>
	<li><strong>访问统计</strong>：本站托管在 Cloudflare，我们使用 Cloudflare 服务端提供的汇总统计（国家/地区、浏览器、来源网站、访问量）。这类统计不会在你的浏览器里写入统计 Cookie，我们也看不到能识别个人身份的信息。</li>
	<li><strong>邮件订阅</strong>：如果你主动订阅，我们会保存你的邮箱地址，只用来发送文章更新。每封邮件都带退订链接，退订后不会再发送。</li>
	<li><strong>评论</strong>：评论功能由 Giscus 提供，基于 GitHub Discussions。发表评论需要登录 GitHub，相关数据适用 GitHub 的隐私政策。</li>
	<li><strong>人机验证</strong>：订阅表单使用 ALTCHA 在你的浏览器本地做计算验证，不追踪你。</li>
	<li><strong>本地偏好</strong>：亮色/暗色主题的选择保存在你浏览器的 localStorage 里，不会上传。</li>
</ul>

<h2>广告与 Cookie</h2>
<p>本站使用 Google AdSense 展示广告：</p>
<ul>
	<li>包括 Google 在内的第三方供应商会使用 Cookie，根据你之前访问本站或其他网站的情况向你展示广告。</li>
	<li>Google 使用广告 Cookie，使它和它的合作伙伴能够根据你访问本站和/或互联网上其他网站的情况向你展示广告。</li>
	<li>你可以在 Google 的<a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">广告设置</a>中关闭个性化广告，也可以通过 <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a> 关闭第三方供应商的个性化广告 Cookie。</li>
	<li>来自欧洲经济区、英国、瑞士以及美国部分州的访客，会看到 Google 提供的同意提示，可以在其中接受、拒绝或管理 Cookie 与广告个性化选项。</li>
	<li>Google 如何使用这些数据，见 <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google 如何使用来自使用其服务的网站的信息</a>。</li>
</ul>

<h2>嵌入内容</h2>
<p>部分文章会嵌入 YouTube 或哔哩哔哩的视频。播放这些视频时，对应平台可能按它们自己的隐私政策收集数据。</p>

<h2>儿童隐私</h2>
<p>本站内容面向成年技术读者，不针对 13 岁以下的儿童，也不会有意收集儿童的个人信息。</p>

<h2>政策变更与联系方式</h2>
<p>本政策如有变更，会更新在本页面，并修改上方的生效日期。如有疑问，请通过页脚的 X 或 GitHub 链接联系我们。</p>

<!--EN-->

<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Effective date: September 24, 2026</p>
<p>This policy explains what information blog.mushroom.cv ("this site") processes when you visit. The site requires no account and never sells personal information.</p>

<h2>Information we collect</h2>
<ul>
	<li><strong>Traffic statistics</strong>: The site is hosted on Cloudflare, and we use Cloudflare's server-side aggregate analytics (country, browser, referrer, page views). These statistics do not set analytics cookies in your browser, and we cannot see personally identifying information.</li>
	<li><strong>Email subscription</strong>: If you choose to subscribe, we store your email address and use it only to send new-article updates. Every email includes an unsubscribe link.</li>
	<li><strong>Comments</strong>: Comments are powered by Giscus, which is built on GitHub Discussions. Commenting requires signing in with GitHub, and GitHub's privacy policy applies to that data.</li>
	<li><strong>Bot protection</strong>: The subscription form uses ALTCHA, which runs a proof-of-work check locally in your browser and does not track you.</li>
	<li><strong>Local preferences</strong>: Your light/dark theme choice is stored in your browser's localStorage and is never uploaded.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
<p>This site uses Google AdSense to show ads:</p>
<ul>
	<li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites.</li>
	<li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
	<li>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ads Settings</a>, or opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
	<li>Visitors from the European Economic Area, the UK, Switzerland and certain US states are shown a consent message provided by Google, where they can accept, reject or manage cookie and ad personalization choices.</li>
	<li>To learn how Google uses this data, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services</a>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Embedded content</h2>
<p>Some articles embed videos from YouTube or Bilibili. When you play them, those platforms may collect data under their own privacy policies.</p>

<h2>Children's privacy</h2>
<p>This site is intended for adult technical readers. It is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their personal information.</p>

<h2>Changes and contact</h2>
<p>If this policy changes, we will update this page and the effective date above. For questions, contact us through the X or GitHub links in the footer.</p>

</Layout>
